{"id": "si-chndm_1915-17-1", "status": "ok", "meta": "Two small fishermen with a rod and a net among rocks at Lobster Cove, Manchester, Massachusetts, a Winslow Homer view under a pale blue sky.", "about": "A rocky cove opens under a pale blue sky, and pinkish cream clouds are reflected in the water. Two tiny fishermen stand among the rocks in the foreground. Both wear caps and blue coats. One holds a rod and the other a net. Winslow Homer painted this view of Lobster Cove at Manchester, Massachusetts, and the Cooper Hewitt, Smithsonian Design Museum holds it.", "museum_record": "https://collection.cooperhewitt.org/view/objects/asitem/id/20682", "inventory_number": "", "dimensions": "", "credit_line": "", "sources": ["https://collection.cooperhewitt.org/view/objects/asitem/id/20682", "https://artnap.com/artwork/si-chndm_1915-17-1"], "check": "clean"}
